'''SoL''': [[Swamp of Sacrifice|Sub-chapter 34 - Swamp of Sacrifice]]<br>'''ItF''': [[Korea (Into the Future)/Outbreak|Chapter 1 - Korea Outbreak]]<br>'''Aku Realms''': [[South Africa (Aku Realm)|South Africa/Hyogo]]<br>'''CotC''': [[Mars (Cats of the Cosmos)/Outbreak|Chapter 1 - Mars Outbreak]]
|latest appearance = '''ZL''': [[Cookie Cutter Ruins|Sub-chapter 12 - Cookie Cutter Ruins]]
|money drop = 60¢ - 237¢
}}

==Enemy==
Znache is a deceptively strong peon with the ability to [[Burrow|burrow]] ''very'' far past your frontline - combined with its Area Attack, you may often find Znache chomping on your [[Cat Base]] before you even notice it's there.

==Strategy==
Use similarly powerful [[:Category:Area Attack Cats|Area Attackers]] of your own to strike Znache when it resurfaces in your backlines. [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|Bird Cat]] and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Titan Cat]] can do this quite effectively in early stages. Other units can also work, but they should be [[:Category:Rusher-class Cats|rushers]] or have to brute-force Znache so it does as little damage as possible to your frontline. It is still just a peon, but that burrow distance is no joke in some stages.

