==Trivia==
*Znache's Japanese name, Nyororon (にょろろん), may be a reference to Nyororon-zoku (ニョロロン族), the Japanese name of the [[wikia:yokaiwatch:Slippery (tribe)|Slippery tribe]] from ''[[wikipedia:Yo-Kai Watch|Yo-Kai Watch]]''. This is supported by how Znache's Japanese description says it can be mistaken for a [[wikipedia:Tsuchinoko|tsuchinoko]], one of the Yo-Kai in the Slippery tribe ([[wikia:yokaiwatch:Noko|Noko]]).
*Znache's Burrow ability may be a reference to [[wikipedia:Atractaspididae|burrowing asps]].
*Znache and [[Zir Zeal]] are tied for the longest burrow distance, at 1,500.

